370 - Christ for the World
 / 
Key: F
Time: 4/4
Tempo: Moderato
Number: 370
Topic: Christian Church - 

Verse 1:
[F]Christ for the [Gm/Bb]world [C]we [F]sing, The [C/E]world [C7/G]to Christ we [F]bring,
[C]With loving [Am]zeal;
[F]The [C]poor, and [F/C]them [C7]that [F]mourn, The [C]faint [F/C]and [C7]overborne,
[F]Sin-sick [C]and [F]sorrow-worn, [Bb]Whom [F/C]Christ [C7]doth [F]heal.

Verse 2:
[F]Christ for [C]the [F]world [C7/G]we sing,
[F]the world [C]to [F]Christ [C7/G]we bring,
[C]with fervent [Am]prayer;
[F]the [C]wayward [F]and the lost,
[F]by [C]restless [F]passions tossed,
[F]redeemed [C7]at [F]countless cost,
[F]from [C]dark [F]despair.

Verse 3:
[F]Christ for [C]the [F]world [C7/G]we sing,
[F]the world [C]to [F]Christ [C7/G]we bring,
[C]with joyful [Am]song;
[F]the [C]newborn [F]souls, whose days,
[F]reclaimed [C7]from [F]error's ways,
[F]inspired [C7]with [F]hope and praise,
[F]to [C]Christ [F]belong.
